{"id":"wb-7-1847","name":"广州湾法国公使署旧址和法军指挥部旧址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"广州湾法国公使署旧址和法军指挥部旧址","text":"广州湾法国公使署旧址和法军指挥部旧址位于中国广东省湛江市霞山区海滨一路3号和延安路1号，两者隔延安路相对。1986年广州湾法国公使署旧址被列为湛江市文物保护单位，2002年被列为广东省文物保护单位。2013年法国公使署旧址和法军指挥部旧址被列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B9%BF%E5%B7%9E%E6%B9%BE%E6%B3%95%E5%9B%BD%E5%85%AC%E4%BD%BF%E7%BD%B2%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80%E5%92%8C%E6%B3%95%E5%86%9B%E6%8C%87%E6%8C%A5%E9%83%A8%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80","revisionId":93125198,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93125198","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/cce7c9ee356b4ba55a53aab7.jpg","title":"广州湾法国公使署旧址(2023年).jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%B9%BF%E5%B7%9E%E6%B9%BE%E6%B3%95%E5%9B%BD%E5%85%AC%E4%BD%BF%E7%BD%B2%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80(2023%E5%B9%B4).jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f9/%E5%B9%BF%E5%B7%9E%E6%B9%BE%E6%B3%95%E5%9B%BD%E5%85%AC%E4%BD%BF%E7%BD%B2%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80%282023%E5%B9%B4%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Chunwai yau","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​广州湾法国公使署旧址(2023年)","width":320,"height":240}}